    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "The sample terrain features use assembled Battlefields: Armageddon scenery. The terrain areas mix dense and light terrain features. Different terrain features affect movement choices and use of Hidden. When placing a terrain feature, leave a gap inside the edge of its terrain area so models coming from outside can stand beside the scenery. Use pieces of comparable size for substitute terrain features. Decide whether each replacement terrain feature is dense or a light terrain feature for its terrain area.",
